WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.750
Type the word jihad into a search engine,

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:06.320
and the words holy war
are rarely far away.

3
00:00:06.370 --> 00:00:10.090
Yet Arabic has its own words
for war and for fighting,

4
00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:12.480
and jihad is not one of them.

5
00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:15.790
In Madinah, the Qur'an did
give permission to fight,

6
00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:17.970
but to those who had been wronged.

7
00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:23.020
So why do most Muslims say the word's
main meaning is a struggle inside?

8
00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:26.000
In this mission, you'll trace
where the word comes from,

9
00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:28.910
and the strict conditions on any fighting.

10
00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:34.000
Then you'll see why most Muslim scholars
reject the claims of extremist groups.

11
00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:37.740
Your mission: find out why
most Muslims see jihad,

12
00:00:37.790 --> 00:00:40.360
above all, as a struggle inside.
